# CWC design system (v1.1 Rutgers Scarlet)

Canonical visuals: Figma `yAwsNNegakKROue3o0CAMJ`. Tokens/detail: `CWC_Health_App/02_CWC_Health_App_Design_Reference_v1.1.md`.

