## UI language & feel

- Supportive copy: **“Help Now” / “You’re not alone”** — not alarmist “EMERGENCY” by default.
- Scarlet = **action** on calm off-white; do not wash screens in red.
- Emergency/destructive differentiate with **black**, not a second red.
- Generous radii (cards ~10–14; pill buttons); soft card shadow ok.
- Mock type scale ≠ production: implement ACC-1 (18pt+ / OS scaling), not literal 14pt mock body.

When UI diverges from Figma/spec, bump design-ref and/or spec version and note the change—don’t silently drift.
